{"id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-defined.md","title":"Defined Value","display":"df-defined — Defined Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-defined","aliases":["88-df-defined"],"display":"df-defined — Defined Value","depends_on":["[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-defined"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-defined</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-defined — Defined Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\in V\">\\(A, B \\in V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (partial function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> (candidate input)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\\)</span> (defined-at predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))\\)</span> (definedness predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>有定义”只读作<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>属于函数图的定义域；定义式不先形成一个可能\n不存在的值再对它量化。部分函数性已经保证该值若存在则唯一且属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)$ (partial function, see [[88-df-partial-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A, B \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}defined}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Defined}(f(x))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Defined}_f(x)","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":953,"backlinks":[{"id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})$ (defined-at predicate, see [[88-df-defined]])"},{"id":"d9706166a50cc2c4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x,z)$ (defined-at predicate, see [[88-df-defined]])"},{"id":"6a215fa4f19a6a0b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p(e)\\downarrow$ (definedness notation, see [[88-df-defined]])"},{"id":"751fadd86ee607f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})$ (defined-at predicate, see [[88-df-defined]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df